{"updated":"2026-09-24T01:32:12.928Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: News live: Marles says ‘legal situation’ of OpenAI breach under investigation; Victoria to allow dogs in pubs under election promise. Elsewhere, turkiye agrees to gradual handover of Bashiqa base to Iraq. And they were labelled 'pervert glasses'. Will a camera-free version transform their image?. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 2.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 47 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.7 near 180 km NW of Hihifo, Tonga. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1.02,1.35,1.46,1.51,1.54,1.57,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.68,1.73,1.78,1.85,1.9,1.95,1.99,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.13,2.18,2.23,2.28,2.31,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.59,2.65,2.72,2.83,2.93,3.04,3.08,3.12,3.16,3.22,3.26,3.32,3.44,3.53,3.59,3.66,3.69,3.75,3.8,3.84,3.89,3.91,3.94,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.11,4.14,4.24,4.3,4.37,4.43,4.49,4.55,4.6,4.64,4.67,4.72,4.84,4.99,5.17,5.68,5.77,5.85,5.91,5.96,6.03,6.08,6.26,6.32,6.47,6.58,6.79,6.87,6.99,7.05,7.11,7.19,7.22,7.27,7.31,7.38,7.44,7.51,7.59,7.67,7.74,7.83,7.89,7.95,8,8.07,8.12,8.19,8.27,8.36,8.47,8.54,8.58,8.63,8.65,8.68,8.71,8.74,8.77,8.86,8.95,9.02,9.09,9.14,9.42,9.47,9.54,9.61,9.68,9.74,9.8,9.85,9.9,9.98,10.04,10.09,10.13,10.18,10.22,10.28,10.3,10.36,10.41,10.47,10.53,10.59,10.66,10.73,10.84,10.91,10.97,11.02,11.11,11.24,11.62,11.7,11.76,11.81,11.87,11.96,12.03,12.09,12.14,12.2,12.24,12.27,12.34,12.38,12.41,12.46,12.5,12.54,12.62,12.68,12.79,12.86,12.91,12.96,12.99,13.04,13.12